  "content": "<div>老外有院子有花园，比较喜欢鼓捣植物、园艺，所以相关的网站流量都很不错。</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.thespruce.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.thespruce.com/</a></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mxf5qv8291_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mxf5qv8291_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个词 fruit fly trap 果蝇诱捕器，就是一个导购需求</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mxf5qv8291_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>直接抄这篇文章，然后去亚马逊找相关产品，挂上购买链接就行 <a href=\"https://www.thespruce.com/get-rid-of-fruit-flies-1388144\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.thespruce.com/get-rid-of-fruit-flies-1388144</a>\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mxf5qv8291_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/mxf5qv8291_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个关键字，是从 <a href=\"https://www.thespruce.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.thespruce.com/</a> 发现的。 从这里我总结出来了，找行业关键字，最好还是去行业网站里去找。</div>",
